---
// SupportSection.astro — Project Sponsorship & Support CTA
---

<section id="apoyo" class="py-20 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-10" data-animate="true">
  <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/10 text-xs text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 font-mono">
      <span>☕</span>
      <span>Proyecto Independiente &bull; Open Source</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-text)]">
      Impulsa el desarrollo de AIES
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-muted)] font-normal leading-relaxed">
      AIES se desarrolla de forma abierta e independiente. Si te ahorra tiempo y tokens en tu flujo diario, o quieres acelerar las siguientes fases de la hoja de ruta, cualquier contribución ayuda a mantener el ritmo de desarrollo.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Cards Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <!-- Buy Me a Coffee Card -->
    <a
      href="https://buymeacoffee.com/wm2jv22vfmx"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4"
    >
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-amber-500 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            ☕
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-[var(--color-text)] group-hover:text-amber-500 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
              Buy Me a Coffee
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Aportación rápida y puntual</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] group-hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">&nearr;</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        Invítame a un café para respaldar el trabajo diario en la arquitectura y el runtime.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        <span>buymeacoffee.com/wm2jv22vfmx</span>
        <span class="text-amber-500 font-medium">Apoyar &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Ko-fi Card -->
    <a
      href="https://ko-fi.com/ezequiel_33"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] hover:border-rose-500/50 hover:bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4"
    >
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-rose-500 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            ❤️
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-[var(--color-text)] group-hover:text-rose-500 dark:group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors">
              Ko-fi
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">0% comisiones directas</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] group-hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">&nearr;</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        Donaciones sin intermediarios o aportaciones recurrentes para sostener la infraestructura.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        <span>ko-fi.com/ezequiel_33</span>
        <span class="text-rose-500 font-medium">Apoyar &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
